        "subject": "LU-20797 llite: assert LL_IO_SCOPE_FILE is 0",
        "message": "LU-20797 llite: assert LL_IO_SCOPE_FILE is 0\n\nll_file_io_scope_set() and the LL_IOC_FLR_SET_MIRROR handler both\nmemset() a struct ll_ioc_io_scope to 0 to represent LL_IO_SCOPE_FILE,\ninstead of assigning the enumerator explicitly. Add a BUILD_BUG_ON()\nso a future renumbering of enum ll_io_scope fails to compile instead\nof silently storing the wrong scope.\n\nFixes: 6dac0dd45f (\"LU-20797 llite: add SET I/O scope ioctl\")\nSigned-off-by: Ronnie Sahlberg <rsahlberg@whamcloud.com>\nChange-Id: I0dedb9b4ca4f7c10413e66274626e477bfb874ee\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
  },
